 and tools to the world of hardware design. See the cite1†call for papers for more details.\nL5: ## Attending LATTE\nL6: \nL7: LATTE is a hybrid workshop; please consider attending either in person (in Pittsburgh, co-located with cite2†ASPLOS†www.asplos-conference.org ) or virtually (on Zoom). LATTE will be held on March 23, 2026.\nL8: \nL9:   * To attend in person, cite3†register to attend ASPLOS workshops†www.asplos-conference.org .\nL10:   * To attend virtually, no conference registration is required. Please cite4†sign up using this Zoom form†cornell.zoom.us to receive a link to join.\nL11: ## LATTE Matrix Chat\nL12: \nL13: We have set up a matrix chat to keep the latte community in touch outside the main LATTE event. cite5†Join it here†matrix.to . Any vaguely LATTE-related discussion is encouraged! Showcase cool projects you built, discuss new ideas or problems you've run into, or just hang out with the community.\nL14: ## Program\nL15: \nL16: Here's the schedule for the workshop. All times are in Pittsburgh time (Eastern Daylight Time (EDT)) on Monday, March 23. Click the time in the left-hand column to see it in your time zone.\nL17: Time (EDT)  | Event\nL18: --- | ---\nL19: cite6†09:00–09:15†zonr.dev | Introduction\nL20: cite7†09:15–10:00†zonr.dev | cite8†Session 1 : High-Level Design Abstractions\nL21: cite9†10:00–10:30†zonr.dev | Coffee Break\nL22: cite10†10:30–11:30†zonr.dev | cite11†Session 2 : Tools\nL23: cite12†11:30–12:00†zonr.dev | cite13†Session 3 : Coroutines\nL24: cite14†12:00–13:30†zonr.dev | Lunch\nL25: cite15†13:30–14:30†zonr.dev | cite16†Session 4 : Hardware Description Languages\nL26: cite17†14:30–15:30†zonr.dev | cite18†Session 5 : Design Automation\nL27: cite19†15:30–16:00†zonr.dev | Coffee Break\nL28: cite20†16:00–17:00†zonr.dev | cite21†Session 6 : Programmable Accelerators\nL29: cite22†17:00–17:45†zonr.dev | cite23†Session 7 : High-Level Design Abstractions\nL30: cite2